.TH scanr-output-summarize 1  "scanr-output-summarize " 
.SH NAME
scanr\-output\-summarize \- Summarize a scan record: totals, and counts by host, network, and service
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBscanr\-output\-summarize\fR [\fB\-\-by\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIFILE\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Summarize a scan record: totals, and counts by host, network, and service
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-by\fR \fI<FIELD>\fR
Show only one section: scan, host, network, port, or service
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR [default: table]
Output shape: table or json
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIFILE\fR>

